      "block_id": "block-001237-a179d53a",
      "type": "list_item",
      "reported_page": 87,
      "preview": "•Other Bets is a combination of multiple operating segments that are not individually material. Revenues from Other Bets are generated primarily from the sale of autonomous transportation services and internet services."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-001238-17d5393a",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "reported_page": 87,
      "preview": "devices, as well as certain operating expenses are directly attributable to our segments. Due to the integrated nature of Alphabet, other costs and expenses, such as technical infrastructure and office facilities, are managed centrally at a consolidated level. These costs, including the associated depreciation, are all"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-001239-ab593ea8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "reported_page": 87,
      "preview": "Certain costs are not allocated to our segments because they represent Alphabet-level activities. These costs primarily include:"
    },
