      "block_id": "block-001243-402df584",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "reported_page": 87,
      "preview": "th employee severance and office space reductions are also not allocated to our segments. Additionally, hedging gains (losses) related to revenue are not allocated to our segments."
    },
